# Duckfoot's interface text, in English (en-US). This file is the source: code names a
# message by its id (i18n::tr), and a test fails when it names one missing here. Another
# language is a sibling folder with the same file; any message it lacks falls back to
# these.

## The phone's tabs

tab-library = library
tab-presets = presets
tab-edit = edit
tab-export = export

## The phone's tour

tour-tabs-title = Four tabs
tour-tabs-text = Library, Presets, Edit and Export. Swipe along this bar to move between them, or tap one. Tap the open tab again to hide its sheet and see the whole photo.
tour-modules-title = Edit, one module at a time
tour-modules-text = Swipe the controls sideways — or tap ‹ › — for the next module. Tap a name in the strip to jump straight to it; tap it again to fold the controls away.
tour-switch-title = On, off, back
tour-switch-text = The switch turns a module on or off, and ⟲ beside ‹ › puts just that module back. ＋ modules at the end of the strip chooses which show: the scope and filmic are in there, off to start.
tour-fine-title = Fine and reset, on every tab
tour-fine-text = FINE makes every slider ten times finer. ⟲ up here resets the whole photo, and undo and redo sit beside it. Double-tap any slider to reset just that one.
tour-presets-title = Presets
tour-presets-text = One tap for sepia, mono, film and more, with a strength slider. A look is an ordinary edit, so you can keep refining it in Edit.
tour-photo-title = The photo
tour-photo-text = Pinch to zoom, and swipe across the photo for the next one. This tour is under Library → ? tour whenever you want it again.
tour-skip = skip
tour-next = Next
tour-done = Done

